  "concepts": [
    {
      "block": 5,
      "text": "\u56e0\u6b64\uff1a\n$(a-b)(a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1})=a^n-b^n$ (1)\u3002"
    },
    {
      "block": 7,
      "text": "\u7279\u522b\u662f\uff0c\u5f53$n=2$\u548c$n=3$\u65f6\uff0c\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f(1)\u5206\u522b\u53d6\u4e0b\u5217\u5f62\u5f0f\uff1a\n$(a-b)(a+b)=a^2-b^2$ (2)\uff0c\n$(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)=a^3-b^3$ (3)\u3002"
    },
    {
      "block": 10,
      "text": "\u5728\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f(3)\u4e2d\uff0c\u7528$-b$\u4ee3\u66ff\u53d8\u91cf$b$\uff0c\u5f97\u5230\uff1a\n$[a-(-b)]\\cdot[a^2+a(-b)+(-b)^2]=a^3-(-b)^3$\uff0c\u5373\uff1a\n$(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2)=a^3+b^3$ (4)\u3002"
    }
  ],
